################################################################################
# Notes:
#
# 1. This Brewfile focuses on GUI apps (casks) only
# 2. CLI tools should remain in the Makefile modules
# 3. Run `brew bundle dump --file=Brewfile.gui --force` to generate this file
#    from your currently installed casks
# 4. Both Makefile and Brewfile approaches can coexist - choose what works best
